      "notes": [
        "Keep family-wide Linux downloads while enforcing a reviewed dependency contract for every bundled ELF object. Ship only Qt, ICU 72 and JPEG ABI 62 privately; use package-managed host graphics and system libraries.",
        "Generate DEB host dependencies and verify all RPM ELF requirements. Test installed packages with Wayland and X11 OpenGL on updated Debian 12/13, Ubuntu 24.04/26.04, Fedora 43/44 and current Arch before release.",
        "Fix the Fedora Wayland startup crash introduced in build 19. Bundled older C++ and Wayland libraries prevented Fedora's Mesa driver from loading. Linux packages now use the host copies and remain compatible with Debian 12."
      ]
